  "capabilities": {
    "tools": {
      "listChanged": true
    }
  },
  "instructions": "This server is SmartPlan: a desktop app of boards for planning work with the user, as Trello's are. A board is lists of cards in order (such as To do, Doing, Done), and each card is a piece of work: a short title, a description in Markdown, labels, a due date and a checklist, all optional but the title.\nYou write and change the cards; the user reads them and drags them between lists as the work moves on. Ask what a new board is for before making it, then create_board with its lists and first cards (with no lists, it gets To do, Doing and Done). Read get_board before changing a board: it gives every list and card by id, and each card's unread (new or updated while the user hasn't opened it yet; null once they have). Cards the user moved since you last looked were moved by them: don't move them back unless they ask.\nadd_cards adds cards to a list, update_card changes only the fields you send, and move_cards moves cards to a list (another, or the same one, to reorder it). Only remove cards or lists (remove_cards, remove_list) when the user asks.\nIf the user's prompt names a window, call use_window with it first, so that window becomes yours.\nEach board has an icon, shown on its tab and on the user's home screen so they can tell it apart at a glance: one with no icon of its own (get_board's and list_boards' icon is null) gets one from you, with create_board's icon or set_icon.",
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "use_window",
      "description": "Takes over a SmartPlan window, when the user's prompt names one: this session then works in it. Call it first, before any other tool, or SmartPlan opens a new window for this session.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "window_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The window named in the prompt, such as w-7f3a"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "window_id"
        ],
        "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#"
      },
      "annotations": {
